Package: my-xymon-extensions
Version: @VERSION@-1
Depends: smartmontools, mmc-utils
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: roemer2201 <r.oliver@web.de>
Source: https://github.com/roemer2201/my-xymon-extensions
Description: Portable Xymon client extensions with standalone runner
 Custom monitoring tests for the Xymon systems monitor, bundled with a
 minimal standalone runner (xymon-run.sh) and protocol sender
 (xymon-send.sh) for hosts without a Xymon client, such as
 OpenWrt/TurrisOS routers.
 Included extensions: smart - S.M.A.R.T. disk health monitoring for
 SATA/ATA and NVMe disks, plus eMMC wear/pre-EOL health via mmc-utils.
